OL,3,GNEWSALost village reappears as drought
OL,4,Acontinues
OL,5,
OL,6,FSevern Trent Water has urged people
OL,7,Fvisiting the area to keep on the paths
OL,8,Fas the exposed reservoir bed is
OL,9,F"extremely muddy and not safe to walk
OL,10,Fon".
